1
00:00:00,833 --> 00:00:04,213
(Howard:)Okay, so I wasn't
exactly John Glenn up there,

2
00:00:04,369 --> 00:00:07,279
(Howard:)but I've changed,
I'm a different man now.

3
00:00:07,439 --> 00:00:11,389
(Howard:)I'm a little insulted that you guys
don't think I can handle it.

4
00:00:11,543 --> 00:00:14,113
(Mike M:)You know you're gonna have to go
through survival training again.

5
00:00:14,179 --> 00:00:15,389
(Penny:)Really?

6
00:00:15,514 --> 00:00:17,824
You've got to get me out of this!

7
00:00:17,950 --> 00:00:20,330
(Doctor:)What do you want me to do?
You're perfectly healthy.

8
00:00:20,486 --> 00:00:22,156
Check my blood pressure again!

9
00:00:22,321 --> 00:00:24,391
(Howard:)I can get it higher,
just give me a second.

10
00:00:26,892 --> 00:00:29,172
(Mrs Wolowitz(on phone):)Hello?
-Hi, Ma. How are you?

11
00:00:30,195 --> 00:00:32,005
How I am is not dead!

12
00:00:32,164 --> 00:00:34,544
(Mrs Wolowitz:)But you wouldn't know that,
because you don't love me enough

13
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:36,010
to pick up the phone!

14
00:00:36,168 --> 00:00:37,578
Go, go, go!

15
00:00:38,737 --> 00:00:42,087
For all you know, l could have
slipped in the tub and drowned!

16
00:00:42,241 --> 00:00:44,351
(Mrs Wolowitz:)That's what happened
to your Aunt Ida!

17
00:00:46,144 --> 00:00:47,684
(Raj:)Wow.

18
00:00:52,151 --> 00:00:54,761
(Raj:)Howard, I'm so sorry your blood
pressure was off the charts.

19
00:00:54,920 --> 00:00:58,600
Me, too. The doctor was willing
to fudge the results,

20
00:00:58,757 --> 00:01:04,027
(Howard:)but it just seemed
so darned dishonest.

